---
import { profile } from "../data/profile";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-line pt-8 lg:mt-36 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] sm:gap-6 lg:block xl:grid">
  <p class="label pt-1 text-subtle">© {year}</p>

  <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-0 lg:mt-4 xl:mt-0">
    <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
      Quer conversar sobre automação, back-end ou algum projeto? Escreva para
      <a
        href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}
        class="whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-subtle/50 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-fg hover:decoration-fg"
        >{profile.email}</a
      >.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-subtle">
      Projetado e desenvolvido por {profile.name}. Feito com Astro e Tailwind CSS, com tipografia IBM Plex.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
